                <h2>From Las Vegas to Utah County</h2>
                <p><strong>TW Trent English</strong> began his pest control career over 25 years ago in Las Vegas, Nevada, where he built <strong>Bite Em Back Pest Control</strong> into one of the most trusted names in the industry.</p>

                <p>His commitment to humane, effective pest control methods and exceptional customer service earned him recognition as a local expert, leading to over <strong>35 television news appearances</strong> on KTNV Channel 13, ABC13, and other major networks.</p>

                <p>When Trent moved to Utah County, he brought his decades of expertise and faith-driven values to serve his new community alongside his brother <strong>Wes</strong>. Together, they founded <strong>Arrow of Light Wildlife & Pest Solutions</strong> with one purpose: <em>remove what blocks your light</em> — and bring more light into an industry that has needed it for far too long.</p>

                <blockquote style="border-left: 4px solid var(--accent); padding-left: 1.5rem; margin: 2rem 0; font-style: italic; color: var(--gray-600);">
                    "Every pest problem is personal. When your family's safety and comfort are at stake, you deserve someone with real experience, not door-knockers or rookies."
                    <cite style="display: block; margin-top: 0.5rem; font-style: normal; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600;">— TW Trent English</cite>
                </blockquote>
            </div>
