            <h2>Why "Arrow of Light"?</h2>
            <p>The name carries the mission.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-content" style="max-width: 780px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: left;">
            <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.8;">We started out as a circle of light — a small group quietly serving the homes around us. As that footprint grew, the circle sharpened into an arrow: focused, direct, pointed at the problems Utah County families actually face.</p>
            <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.8;">Pest control has been under-regulated for too many years. Too much of the industry runs on a million-dollar door-knocking mentality, with not enough inspectors enforcing education and compliance. We're here to bring more light into that — through real expertise, honest work, and standards that hold up to a third-party inspection.</p>
            <blockquote style="border-left: 4px solid var(--accent); padding-left: 1.5rem; margin: 2rem 0; font-style: italic; color: var(--gray-600);">
                "We started as the circle of light, and grew into the arrow of light. We're here to make a difference — for our neighbors, for this industry, and for every home we step into."
                <cite style="display: block; margin-top: 0.5rem; font-style: normal; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600;">— Trent &amp; Wes English</cite>
            </blockquote>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

